  </tr><tr height=80>
    <td colspan=3 bgcolor="#D8F8F8" valign=top><font size=2>Man....I've always loved dungeon crawls. As a rogue, I feel I'm at my best in a dungeon where I can skulk around... <br> &nbsp;<br> The idea to this really appeals to me. &nbsp;It is built exactly for a player like me, who may not have huge blocks of time. &nbsp;It's also very helpful to a guild like us who has difficulty drafting 30 players for a raid, but can easily get a well-balanced group together for a 1-2 hour dungeon adventure. <br> &nbsp;<br> Kudos to SOE for coming up with something that can be enjoyed by the average player rather than huge oobah guilds! <br> &nbsp;<br> </font></td>
  </tr><tr>
    <td colspan=3 bgcolor="#DEE7EF"><font size=2>&nbsp;
